 "notes": [
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0733.mbb#0.30",
   "note": "Speakers verified against Event/Dg/N/C07/0733.bla (TextIdOffset 0, entry = n+1). Block #0.9-38 is pairs (8+2i, 9+2i) in check order Zero, Mebius, OOO, W, 00, Wing Zero, Taro, Seven, Ultraman, Den-O, Black RX, Rider 1, God Gundam, Zeta, Nu; so #0.30 = Black RX 2nd line, #0.31-32 Rider 1, #0.33-34 God Gundam, #0.35-36 Zeta, #0.37-38 Nu. Identical Japanese kept identical with the variants in story_167."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0733.mbb#0.33",
   "note": "God Gundam/Zeta/Nu say 'negative power' where the Rider/Ultra variants say 'evil power'; kept the distinction."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0733.mbb#0.36",
   "note": "Kamille's signature cry from the Zeta finale; rendered as the stretched shout 'Get out of heeere!!'."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0733.mbb#0.38",
   "note": "Nu Gundam (Amuro): 'your ego' kept as the CCA ego theme."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0733.mbb#0.42",
   "note": "Belial's self-honorific (ore-sama) rendered as 'The great me'."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0733.mbb#0.44",
   "note": "#0.44-58 are one line per party member: the second Pt_Chara_Check chain picks the first three party members found in order Zero, Nu, OOO, Mebius, Zeta, W, Ultraman, 00, Den-O, Seven, Wing Zero, Black RX, Taro, God Gundam, Rider 1, and each speaks its own line. Same order applies to the leader blocks #0.62-76, #0.81-95, #0.101-115 (speaker = first found member)."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0733.mbb#0.59",
   "note": "Veda being eroded: matches story_157 'erosion of Veda'. Seravee's Voice (Tieria) at #0.59-61."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0733.mbb#0.65",
   "note": "Mebius variant adds -san to Seravee; honorific dropped per style, so identical to the others."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0733.mbb#0.99",
   "note": "Ankh refers back to the earlier line 'The enemy calls this world Regis'."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0733.mbb#0.109",
   "note": "#0.109 = Den-O (Momotaros) variant, rougher ending; rendered with 'dammit'."
  }
 ],
 "report": "80/80 rows. Speakers verified against 0733.bla; labels for leader blocks derived from three Pt_Chara_Check chains (see notes). No new names or terms. Veda erosion follows story_157."
